# Super Speed: "Flash. Enchant creature. When this Aura enters, enchanted creature gains first strike until end of turn. Enchanted
# creature gets +1/+0 and has haste." Bot1 casts a Memnite and then Super Speed on it the same turn: a 2/1 with first strike and
# haste attacks at once (Bot2 takes 2, 18). On Bot2's upkeep (turn 2) the Aura is still on it - 2/1, haste, but the first strike
# ended with turn 1. Super Speed has flash: a second one, cast on Bot2's upkeep onto the same Memnite, gives first strike again
# that turn only (3/1), and on turn 3 it is a 3/1 with haste and no first strike.

